# Errant Minion's "Prevent X of that damage" is a prevention effect on that damage, which the player it would be dealt to orders
# with the event's other replacement effects (CR 615.1a, 616.1). Bot1 controls Furnace of Rath and an Errant Minion on Bot2's
# Memnite. At Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 Bot2 pays one mana and has the Furnace apply first: 4 damage, 1 of it prevented, Bot2 takes 3.
# On turn 6 Bot2 pays one again and has the Minion's prevention apply first: 1 of the 2 prevented, the other 1 doubled, Bot2 takes 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Furnace of Rath
Errant Minion
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Furnace of Rath.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Errant Minion.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.PayCost(Times: 1)
Bot2.Replace(Furnace of Rath)
? Bot2.Life = 17
[T6 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.PayCost(Times: 1)
Bot2.Replace(Errant Minion)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot1.Life = 20
Prevented = 1 Errant Minion > Bot2 by Errant Minion; 1 Errant Minion > Bot2 by Errant Minion
